## Key Concepts
- Global vs per-device PCA; memory budgeting; loadings interpretation; on-device projection math.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Simple on-device projection (pseudo)
function project(x, mu, W){
  x = x.map((v,i)=> isNaN(v)? mu[i] : v);
  x = x.map((v,i)=> (v - mu[i]));
  return dot(x, W); // 40x5 matrix multiply
}
```

